Package: alien-wallpaper-migrate
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: alien-wallpapers, pcmanfm-qt
Maintainer: Alien OS Team <team@alienos.org>
Description: Alien OS wallpaper migration helper
 Autostart-once script that migrates existing user homes from old Alien default
 wallpaper paths (alien-bg1.png, alien-bg2.png) to the new panel_3_1 default.
 Never overrides a custom wallpaper chosen by the user. Tracked by a version
 marker in ~/.config/alien/ to run exactly once per upgrade.
